  "data": {
    "ruleType": "core-ability",
    "group": "Core",
    "summary": "Whenever this unit makes a [Fall Back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back), [Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move):\n\n- Its models can move through other models, **MONSTER** and **VEHICLE** models included but not **TITANIC** ones, and horizontally through terrain feature sections 4\" or less high.\n- Before the unit moves, you can give all its models the **MOBILE** keyword for that move. If you do, roll a D6 as the move ends, and the unit becomes Battle-shocked on a 1.\n\n**Designer's Note**: with **MOBILE**, the models can cross dense terrain features horizontally during that move (13.06).",
